<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 134 0 R
/E ("Touchless spray drones" are ineffective for heavy urban dirt. Effective cleaning requires physical contact. Our concept is a "Flying Floor Scrubber" with an active rotary brush, integrating thermal-based maintenance audits during the cleaning process.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
